      "comment": "SPORT SCOUT (6) flew the lids off the inside with a slick early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fourth (22.82) over 400m at this track. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. ASTON MORENO (1) was in the minors two back then strongly fancied last time at Horsham where she led until late, recording another placing when third (23.61) in a Grade 5. Has a good record here including six wins. Will give a great sight again. VOLTS (8) had the drop on the lead from the squeeze box before taking over turning, drawing clear to score (22.85) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. One of the leading chances again. STAR OF ROXY (2) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
